      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/53a042/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-18T15:55:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If the Hero deck card count does not include the character cards then many of these decks have more unique card art than all of the currently existing hero decks. I think the current highest is 20 (Chrono Ranger and Argent Adept). If the count includes Character card's front and back art then the highest is 22. Either way Benchmark is way higher than any existing deck.</p>",
