      "created_at": "2017-10-18T22:25:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm glad this image is bigger, the twitter version was too small for me to make anything out.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I find it interesting that \"The Abyss Stares Back\" is a seperate art. I think I remeber that as a card in Oblivaeon's deck, so I'm guessing now it is a card that goes into play like the shields, which makes things interesting if we consider each form is going to have a unique set of cards that come into play with it.</p>",
