      "created_at": "2017-10-20T15:51:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In the Oversized Villain card pack (with the new art), the Spite promo is called \"Spite: Agent of Chaos\" instead of \"Agent of Gloom.\"</p><p><span>Probably correcting that for the foil pack.</span></p>",
