      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>https://i.imgur.com/lRo7vXa.jpg is the current Agent of Chaos Logo, which I suspect is the art in question. On another note, I&#39;ve realised that decks with more than 20 arts are required to have at least one unique card ,in fact they must have (X-20)*2 unique cards, where X is the number of arts for that deck (and that&#39;s given that all the other arts appear exactly twice each). Given that &quot;New hero character cards&quot; is it&#39;s own post-it, you can likely say they aren&#39;t included in the deck counts, so it looks like Benchmark has at least&nbsp;<strong>12</strong> unique cards! (of course, that includes the assumption that there&#39;s only 40 cards in his deck...)</p>",
