      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/df788c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-23T23:24:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ok so, if there are only cards of which there are 1 or 2 copies, then there must be exactly 12 unique cards and 14 duoque cards (12<em>1 &amp; 14</em>2).</p>\n<p>If there's the option of 3 copies of a card then here's a table:</p>\n<p>W is number of unique cards, X is number of duoque cards and Z is the number of trioque cards.</p>\n<p>W |X | Y</p>\n<p>13|12|1</p>\n<p>14|10|2</p>\n<p>15|08|3</p>\n<p>16|06|4</p>\n<p>17|04|5</p>\n<p>18|02|6</p>\n<p>19|00|7</p>\n<p>Adding in the possibility of 4 of a kind (a quartique, if you will) means generating multiple tables, one for each value of Z, the number of quartiques:</p>\n<p>Z=1</p>\n<p>W |X | Y</p>\n<p>15|09|0</p>\n<p>16|07|1</p>\n<p>17|05|2</p>\n<p>18|03|3</p>\n<p>19|01|4</p>\n<p>Z=2</p>\n<p>W |X | Y</p>\n<p>16|08|0</p>\n<p>17|06|1</p>\n<p>18|04|2</p>\n<p>19|02|3</p>\n<p>20|00|4</p>\n<p>Z=3</p>\n<p>W |X | Y</p>\n<p>18|05|0</p>\n<p>19|03|1</p>\n<p>20|01|2</p>\n<p>Z=4</p>\n<p>W |X | Y</p>\n<p>20|02|0</p>\n<p>21|00|1</p>\n<p>(If Z&gt;5 X or Y must be negative to compensate and you can't ship negative cards)</p>\n<p>Boy this was more work than I should've given it  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=9\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"></p>\n<p>EDIT: Oh hey it was all for naught, the count includes some character cards so the actual count comes down to&nbsp;<span>9 unique, 10 duos, 1 trio and 2 quartets from here:&nbsp;</span><span><a href=\"https://twitter.com/GTGChristopher/status/922610361353809920\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://twitter.com/GTGChristopher/status/922610361353809920</a></span></p>",
